# Agent Chat Table Entry

## Metadata

```yaml
format: uimd
format-version: 1
kind: component
status: draft
description: "Heron-style simulated agent Markdown table block."
tags: [component, simulation]
```

## Definition

```yaml
extends: uicontrol
```

## Members

```yaml
heading:
  type: spanlabel
  text: "Table"
  description: "Table title."

table:
  type: messagetable
  text: ""
  description: "Rendered Markdown table content."
```

## Style

```yaml
this:
  border-width: 0
  background: "#00000000"
@table_panel:
  background: "#00000000"
  padding: 0, 1, 0, 1
@heading:
  color: "#ddd6fe"
@table:
  color: "#cbd5e1"
```

